<html lang='es'><head><meta charset='utf-8' /><meta
      name='viewport'
      content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1'
    /><title>Resultado de operación</title><style>
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      body {
        font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
        max-width: 70rem;
        margin: 2rem auto;
        padding: 0 1rem;
        color: #172d24;
      }
      nav {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 1rem;
        align-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }
      nav form {
        margin-left: auto;
      }
      a {
        color: #174b37;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      }
      input,
      select,
      button {
        font: inherit;
        max-width: 100%;
        padding: 0.5rem;
      }
      label {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 0.8rem;
      }
      .filters {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.8rem;
        align-items: end;
      }
      .filters label {
        min-width: 0;
        flex: 1 1 12rem;
      }
      .filters input,
      .filters select {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
      }
      .table-scroll {
        overflow-x: auto;
        max-width: 100%;
      }
      table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
      }
      th,
      td {
        padding: 0.6rem;
        text-align: left;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
      }
      .pagination {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-top: 1rem;
      }
      .error {
        color: #8c2036;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      }
      main form:not(.filters) {
        max-width: 36rem;
      }
      main form:not(.filters) input,
      main form:not(.filters) select {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
      }
      main form button {
        margin-top: 1rem;
      }
      dt {
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-top: 1rem;
      }
      dd {
        margin-left: 0;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      }
      summary {
        cursor: pointer;
        padding: 0.75rem 0;
      }
      @media (max-width: 480px) {
        body {
          margin: 1rem auto;
        }
        h1 {
          font-size: 1.6rem;
        }
        nav {
          gap: 0.7rem;
        }
        nav form {
          margin-left: 0;
          width: 100%;
        }
      }
    </style></head><body><nav aria-label='Administración'><a
        href='/admin/products'
      >Productos</a><a href='/admin/stores'>Tiendas</a><a
        href='/admin/deliveries'
      >Entregas</a><form method='post' action='/admin/logout'><input
          type='hidden'
          name='_csrf'
          value='{{csrf}}'
        /><button type='submit'>Cerrar sesión</button></form></nav><main><h1
      >Operación no confirmada · {{status}}</h1><p
        role='alert'
        class='error'
      >{{message}}</p><p><a href='{{checkUrl}}'>Consultar estado vigente</a></p><p
      ><a href='/admin/deliveries'>Consultar entregas</a></p><p>No se reenviará
        la solicitud automáticamente. Una recarga del formulario anterior podría
        repetir la operación; consulte primero el resultado.</p></main></body></html>